#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, keyboardModelComboBox)
#: kcm_keyboard.ui:50
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you do not know what kind of keyboard you "
"have.\n"
msgstr ""
"Disini anda boleh memilih model papan kekunci. Tetapan ini adalah tidak "
"berkaitan dengan susunatur papan kekunci anda dan merujuk kepada model "
"\"perkakasan\", contoh. cara papan kekunci anda dikilangkan. Papan kekunci "
"moden yang datang dengan komputer anda biasanya mempunyai dua kekunci ekstra "
"dan dirujuk sebagai model \"104-kekunci\", yang mungkin anda mahu jika anda "
"tidak mengetahui jenis papan kekunci yang anda ada.\n"

